Hello,

this board/calibration file (and regdb file) is for a device I'm 
upstreaming currently,

* description for what hardware this is:
   - a smartphone, Motorola edge 30 (codename dubai) based on the SM7325 
SoC and a WCN6750 Wi-Fi module

* origin of the board file
   - Extracted from bdwlan.elf.dubai.ipa (the only bdwlan file 
mentioning the particular device codename) and regdb.bin on the vendor 
partition on the device.

* ids to be used with the board file:
   - WCN6750 hw1.0
      + bus=ahb,qmi-chip-id=1,qmi-board-id=255,variant=Motorola_dubai

